msgid "Limited Zombie Revival"
msgstr "制限付きゾンビ復活"

msgid ""
"Zombies still rise, but never at full strength.  A corpse that gets up comes "
"back weakened in proportion to how badly it was mangled, spends a while "
"helpless and stiff after rising, and can only rise a limited number of times "
"before it is too broken to move again.  An alternative to disabling revival "
"entirely."
msgstr ""
"ゾンビは起き上がるが、万全の状態では戻ってこない。損壊が酷い死体ほど弱く、遅く蘇り、"
"起き上がった直後はしばらく無力で、死後硬直で動きも鈍い。さらに同じ死体が起き上がれる"
"回数にも上限がある。復活を完全に禁止する代わりの選択肢。"

msgid "Rigor Mortis"
msgstr "死後硬直"

msgid ""
"Death has already stiffened these limbs.  Every step is a fight against its "
"own body."
msgstr "死によって四肢が硬直している。一歩ごとに自分の体と格闘している。"

msgid "The %s is too broken to rise again."
msgstr "%sは壊れすぎていて、もう起き上がれない。"
